#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:5 8972731cca7844439694caad25a0b5b2
msgid "MAVLink Basics"
msgstr "MAVLink 基础"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:7 1adb867c3db4414886fc4fad2aa6eabb
msgid ""
"`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ is a serial protocol most commonly "
"used to send data and commands between vehicles and ground stations"
msgstr "`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ 是一种串行协议，最常用于在载具与地面站之间传输数据和命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:9 fad1249b749e4f5b9d043db98d1c63a6
msgid ""
"The protocol defines a large set of messages which can be found in "
"`common.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ and "
"`ardupilot.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"该协议定义了大量消息，见 `common.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ "
"和 `ardupilot.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:10 a08039f9e5ca4382980d0c45fc86ba23
msgid ""
"MAVLink messages can be sent over almost any serial connection and does "
"not depend upon the underlying technology (wifi, 900mhz radio, etc)"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息可通过几乎任何串行连接发送，不依赖底层技术（WiFi、900MHz 电台等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:11 598bb1e2ad4a44bfa098ebb5b500d0ce
msgid ""
"The messages are not guaranteed to be delivered which means ground "
"stations or companion computers must often check the state of the vehicle"
" to determine if a command has been executed"
msgstr "消息不保证送达，因此地面站或伴飞计算机通常需要检查飞行器状态以确认命令是否已执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:14 aca129886ac347d58aa08c904ca440d8
msgid "Message Format"
msgstr "消息格式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:20 72d9f93443c64cff9e4f77ade000cf29
msgid ""
"Messages are no more than 263 bytes (Mavlink version1.0) or 280 bytes "
"(Mavlink version 2.0)."
msgstr "消息长度不超过 263 字节（MAVLink 1.0 版）或 280 字节（MAVLink 2.0 版）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:21 313bf748fc89419b9196a0609a14579c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sender always fills in the ``System ID`` and ``Component ID`` fields "
"so that the receiver knows where the packet came from.  The ``System ID``"
" is a unique ID for each vehicle or ground station.  Ground stations "
"normally use a high system id like \"255\" and vehicles default to use "
"\"1\" (this can be changed by setting the :ref:`MAV_SYSID <MAV_SYSID>` "
"parameter, see also :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID<MAV_GCS_SYSID>` and "
":ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID_HI<MAV_GCS_SYSID_HI>`).  The ``Component ID`` for the"
" ground station or flight controller is normally \"1\".  Other MAVLink "
"capable device on the vehicle (i.e. companion computer, gimbal) should "
"use the same ``System ID`` as the flight controller but use a different "
"``Component ID``"
msgstr ""
"发送方总是填写 ``System ID`` 和 ``Component ID`` 字段，让接收方知道数据包来自哪里。``System ID`` "
"是每台载具或地面站的唯一 ID。地面站通常用 \"255\" 这样的高位系统 ID，载具默认用 \"1\"（可通过 :ref:`MAV_SYSID"
" <MAV_SYSID>` 参数修改）。地面站或飞控的 ``Component ID`` 通常是 \"1\"。载具上其他具备 MAVLink "
"能力的设备（如协处理器、云台）应使用与飞控相同的 ``System ID``，但使用不同的 ``Component ID``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:22 f65b3cf769414aa48280f702049e5c78
msgid ""
"The ``Message ID`` field can be seen in the `common.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ and `ardupilot.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__ next to the "
"message name.  For example the `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ message Id is "
"\"0\""
msgstr ""
"``Message ID`` 字段可在 `common.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ 和 `ardupilot.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__ 中消息名旁边查到。例如 "
"`HEARTBEAT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息的 "
"Id 是 \"0\""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:23 fceb0a4488b343869ac910659ff892a3
msgid ""
"The ``Data`` portion of the message holds the individual field values "
"being sent"
msgstr "消息的 ``Data`` 部分包含发送的各个字段值。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:24 e7362298d1464ff0a0d33611bdfbcd88
msgid ""
"See this page for advice on how to :ref:`add support for a new MAVLink "
"message <code-overview-adding-a-new-mavlink-message>`"
msgstr ""
"关于如何 :ref:`为新的 MAVLink 消息添加支持 <code-overview-adding-a-new-mavlink-"
"message>`，请参考该页面的建议"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:27 b3fb4055fd74498d9aba309d7d50eacc
msgid "High Level Message Flow"
msgstr "高层消息流程"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:33 c658ad1878094d87b2f0577948f8bc15
msgid ""
"Once a connection is opened each device (aka \"System\") sends the "
"`HEARTBEAT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ "
"message at 1hz"
msgstr ""
"连接建立后，每台设备（即\"系统\"）以 1hz 发送 `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:34 1f4c8b56ebc14fba891757b96a94ce3e
msgid ""
"The ground station or companion computer :ref:`requests the data "
"<mavlink-requesting-data>` it wants (and the rate) by sending messages of"
" the following types"
msgstr "地面站或协处理器通过发送以下类型的消息 :ref:`请求所需数据 <mavlink-requesting-data>` （及其速率）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:36 6a28d32dafc44eb783345cfcbdf57f21
msgid ""
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ "
"supports setting the rate of groups of messages"
msgstr ""
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ "
"支持按消息组设置速率"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:37 39d0f8dd2b144c198a88819911ea6aee
msgid ""
"`COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ containing a"
" `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" command provides precise control of which messages are sent (and their "
"rate) but is only supported on ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""
"包含 `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" 命令的 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"可精确控制发送哪些消息（及其速率），但仅 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本支持"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:39 09e95eee94834350887018d2048c70bc
msgid ""
"Ground station or companion computer send commands to the vehicle.  "
"Details of the supported commands are :ref:`here for copter <copter-"
"commands-in-guided-mode>` and :ref:`plane <plane-commands-in-guided-"
"mode>`"
msgstr ""
"地面站或协处理器向载具发送命令。支持的命令详见 :ref:`Copter 命令 <copter-commands-in-guided-mode>`"
" 和 :ref:`Plane 命令 <plane-commands-in-guided-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:42 8d880f65f34344d9bac7134cd7884a00
#, fuzzy
msgid "MAVLink1(v1) vs MAVLink2(v2)"
msgstr "MAVLink1 与 MAVLink2 对比"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:43 d37be231e50241f5bac98a52621fdede
msgid ""
"In this document, MAVLink protocol versions v1 and v2 are referred to as "
"MAVLink1 and MAVLink2 respectively. - MAVLink2 messages have a maximum of"
" 280 bytes of length, as they implement compatibility flags and support "
"for signature. - MAVLink2 extends MAVLink1 by allowing new fields to be "
"added to existing MAVLink1 messages, supports new messages with ``Message"
" ID`` over \"255\" and adds support for signing messages - MAVLink2 is "
"backwards compatible with MAVLink1 meaning that if a device understands "
"MAVLink2 messages it certainly understands MAVLink1 messages - If a "
"device only capable of understanding MAVLink1 receives a message that "
"includes additional fields (added under MAVLink2) the device will only "
"see the original fields.  I.e. the device will be able to read the "
"message but will not \"see\" the additional fields - A flight "
"controller's serial port (presumably connected to a telemetry radio) can "
"be set to use MAVLink2 by setting the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter to "
"\"2\" (where \"x\" is the serial port number on the flight controller) -"
"  See `Mavlink2 Documentation "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/guide/mavlink_2.html>`__ for more information "
"(especially on message extensions)"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "MAVLink2 messages have a maximum of "
#~ "280 bytes of length, as they "
#~ "implement compatibility flags and support "
#~ "for signature."
#~ msgstr "MAVLink2 消息最大长度为 280 字节，因为它实现了兼容性标志和签名支持。"

